# Copy to `.env.local` (git-ignored via `*.local`) and point at whichever host is running EAMS.Api.
#
# Include the `/api/v1` prefix; no trailing slash. Unset, `src/api.ts` falls back to
# http://localhost:5080/api/v1 — the URL `dotnet run --urls "http://localhost:5080"` serves.
#
# Vite inlines this at BUILD time, not at runtime: a bundle built without it has the localhost
# default baked in and cannot be repointed afterwards.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5080/api/v1
